flowchart LR
  PR[Pull Request] --> API[API check + tests]
  PR --> WORKER[Worker check + tests]
  PR --> TF[Terraform fmt + validate + static checks]
  PR --> PG[PostgreSQL 16 ephemeral]
  PG --> INIT[init-db.js]
  INIT --> STD[6 standard migrations]
  STD --> AUTH[secure API-key auth migration]
  AUTH --> RLS[runtime-role RLS migration]
  RLS --> DENIAL[6 real-login denial tests]
  DENIAL --> HTTP[Fastify.inject API test]
  DENIAL --> WH[Worker hermetic test]
  API --> GATE{All green?}
  WORKER --> GATE
  TF --> GATE
  HTTP --> GATE
  WH --> GATE
  GATE -->|yes| IMG[Immutable RC images]
  GATE -->|no| STOP[Block release]
